### Paragraph 1 (Text: "The first category of sampling techniques is **Sampling from Current Layer**. This approach involves selecting nodes from the current layer of the neural network during the training process, rather than relying on previous layers. It is particularly useful for tasks where the current layer has the most relevant features for the prediction task, such as in deep learning models with high-dimensional feature spaces. This technique has been applied in recent works on dynamic neural architectures and real-time data processing systems."):

